      "value": "@{5b81aa8964ecac2f8b14382e|full_name}: I feel like VRChat is the entry point for a lot of people into VR. With haptic vests as low as $99, and the fact that VRChat is a game about interacting in a virtual environment, it should be something on the radar. I imagine the possibilities of playing any of the VRChat games (like Battle Discs) when you can feel a hit.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
